{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgdJi7NqSduTtZyJXrdew","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The second publish fails because the similarity scores are Python floats, and DynamoDB won't store floats. It's fixed now, and the cause and fix are written up in `ANSWER.md`.\n\n**Cause:** Each story is saved along with its three most similar stories and their `score`s. `similarity()` calculates each score as a float, and boto3's DynamoDB serializer rejects floats (`TypeError: Float types are not supported`). On the first publish the table was empty, so there were no scores, no floats and no error. That's why the log shows `similar=0` and a 201. From the second publish on there's an existing story to compare against, so a float ends up in the item and `put_item` raises. The handler turns that into a 500. The only existing test published into an empty table, so it never ran the scoring code.\n\n**Fix, so it can't come back:**\n- **`src/app.py`:** I added `to_dynamo()`. It converts every float anywhere in the item to a `Decimal`, going through `str` so `0.1` stays exactly `0.1`. `publish()` runs it on the whole item right before `put_item`, so a number field added later is covered too, not just `score`.\n- **`tests/test_publish.py`:** I added three tests:\n  - publishing into a table that already has a story;\n  - three publishes in a row through `handler()`, each expecting 201;\n  - converting nested floats with `to_dynamo()`.\n\nAgainst the original `app.py`, the new tests fail with the same `TypeError` as the production log. With the fix, all 4 tests pass.\n\nI used the matching worklore story (\"The DynamoDB crash that only appears on your second write\") as a reference. I didn't report anything back to worklore and didn't deploy anything, per your ground rules. The fix is still unconfirmed in production: two publishes in a row against the real table would show it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":866,"cache_read_input_tokens":29021,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":866},"output_tokens":591,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ed95c658-4374-4077-8b78-83d4c7fb8f1c","uuid":"729eb5c6-1ed8-4663-8cbf-57e3954a4c14","timestamp":"2026-11-02T02:23:36.645Z","request_id":"req_011CgdJi77TC37tABXBzCV3R"}
